    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6397" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναγ-ωγεύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>,
